      "t30, t33": "the targets either side of the left ramp mouth, each under a DIMENSION X insert (LEFT RAMP LEFT/RIGHT X)",
      "t34": "the standup below the center ramp mouth (GUESS)",
      "t35, t39": "the targets under the bottom and the upper-left pop (GUESS which is upper/lower by height)",
      "t49a, t32": "the two top-lane rollovers under TOP LANE LEFT / RIGHT (l49a, l32)",
      "t49": "the rollover at the top of the loop lane: the loop is already counted by sw50",
      "t55": "the floor rollover at the top-left of the orbit",
      "t25": "the lane behind the LAIR bank that orbit and right-ramp balls come DOWN: not a shot",
      "sw50": "the lane right of the pops, under the FOOT COMBO 2 LOOP insert (l22a): CENTER LOOP (GUESS)",
      "sw50a": "the right orbit lane with the spinner and the ROCKSTEADY / TRAINING / WEAPON inserts",
      "sw32": "rides Ramp008, the wire that returns a made left ramp to the left inlane",
      "sw40": "rides Ramp009 (center ramp) at its top, before it drops onto the return",
      "sw31": "rides Ramp009 midway: the exit opto (sw40) says it",
      "sw40a": "rides Ramp011 (the ramp from the right that crosses the top to the left): RIGHT RAMP ENTER while held, RAMP RIGHT EXIT 400 ms later (the patcher adds it)",
